# Regenerable training data, and far too large to commit. Re-create with:
#   .venv/Scripts/python.exe .../train/gen_data.py     -> gridop_data.npz  (350 MB, 21M cell samples)
#   .venv/Scripts/python.exe .../train/gen_grids.py    -> grids.npz        (40 MB, 1301 whole grids)
#   .venv/Scripts/python.exe .../train/rollout_check.py -> rollouts.npz
# The TRAINED WEIGHTS (weights.npz, weights_grid.npz) are small and ARE committed, so nothing here has
# to be re-run to reproduce the profiling result.
gridop_data.npz
grids.npz
rollouts.npz
__pycache__/
